\par \pard\tx355 The current selection path is displayed above the tree window (e.g. Mouse).
\par \pard\tx355 
\par \pard\tx355 \b Left Mouse Click Button Assignment\plain\fs24  tab and \b Middle Mouse Click Assignment\plain\fs24  tab use the same Middle Mouse Button Adjustment tree.
