\pard\keepn \b\fs36\cf1 User Toolbar Buttons
\par \pard \plain\fs24 
\par \{bmc bm0.bmp\} \ul Click\plain\fs24 {\v CLICK@Sem.HLP} on the \b Left Mouse Click Button Assignments\plain\fs24   tab to make the Tool Bar buttons accessible.
